 "comments": [
  {
   "rating": 6,
   "date": "2006-12-09T22:24:21-06:00",
   "body": "Invader's Scourgestones drops from lvl 58+ mobs, the drop rate is big in instances like Scholomance and Stratholme etc etc. Farming Invader's Scourgestones is a nice way to get Argent Dawn reputation.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 2,
   "date": "2006-12-09T09:06:24-06:00",
   "body": "You receive 25 Argent Dawn rep each time you turnin this quest.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2006-09-18T23:59:58-05:00",
   "body": "How much rep does this turn in give you?",
   "replies": [
    "Turning in the Scourgestones for the Valor Token gives you 25 rep.  However that is just for the turn-in.  \n\nThere are different things you can do with the Valor Token that will give you varying amounts of additional rep, such as turning them in straight up (for 25 rep) or exchanging them for Writs (for 10 rep plus a chance for even more rep by completing Writ)."
   ]
  },
